{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top-down roguelite action RPG built around deliberate, tactical combat and build-driven runs. Master telegraphed enemies, manage scarce healing, and forge powerful builds as you fight your way through a fractured world. Each run plays like an ARPG season in miniature: gather relics, shape your build, and push deeper into the shattered realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has fractured into a chaos of drifting realms. The gods have fallen silent, their power left behind you to harness. You are an unbound child of the divine, a spirit possessing mortal vessels in a desperate, cyclical journey toward the world\u2019s core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end. It is a necessary retreat. Early runs can be challenging, but each failure brings you back stronger, revealing new truths, new powers, and a path closer to restoring this broken reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/3a100d1c39b07602b4cf58c5a5ff346a.poster.avif?t=1773908391\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/3a100d1c39b07602b4cf58c5a5ff346a.webm?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/3a100d1c39b07602b4cf58c5a5ff346a.mp4?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deliberate Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fight for survival revolves around using your weapon, spells, or a mix of both in deliberate combat inspired by souls-like combat. Enemy attacks are clearly telegraphed, but your approach is defined by the tools and build you select: do you rely on positioning, dodges and parries, control foes with stagger and status effects, or maintain distance with spell-heavy precision? Every encounter is designed around clarity and avoidable damage. Health and healing are scarce, ensuring that the better you master your current build's specific strengths, the further you will push into the shattered realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be approachable but rewarding, the game encourages experimentation and persistence: permanent upgrades and growing familiarity with your build gradually shift the balance in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/34988c3f6815e806d976bd10cd35ae33.poster.avif?t=1773908391\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/34988c3f6815e806d976bd10cd35ae33.webm?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/34988c3f6815e806d976bd10cd35ae33.mp4?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buildcraft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful synergies and make run-defining choices to craft your character's build. While combat mastery is core, smart build decisions can dramatically amplify your strengths or open entirely new playstyles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and Spells: Choose your weapon and spells for the run from randomized options with different playstyles and strengths each</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talents: Choose from a few randomized talents on most level-ups, with rarities from Common to Epic and rare Legendary powers unlocked through endgame Realm Distortions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Relics: Find powerful artifacts the vanished gods left behind, immediately providing a major power boost and shaping your build's direction (e.g., elemental mastery or defensive fortitude).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infusions: Transform your abilities with these modifications, allowing you to spec spells into specialized tools, like a mana-restoring engine or a critical-strike trigger.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forks of Fate: Twice in a run, you must choose between significant run-long tradeoffs. Do you chase raw power, embrace calculated risk, or balance both?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/350fbd530c1a4c09c9826c23fa777de3.poster.avif?t=1773908391\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/350fbd530c1a4c09c9826c23fa777de3.webm?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/350fbd530c1a4c09c9826c23fa777de3.mp4?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lasting Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attempt leaves something behind for you to build on. Titan essence collected during a run can be invested in the Sanctuary to unlock permanent upgrades, transforming every death into a step toward victory. Permanent upgrades steadily increase your survivability and power, making each new attempt more powerful and flexible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/2f42c3a8df0f9579306f585e4bfecc73.poster.avif?t=1773908391\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/2f42c3a8df0f9579306f585e4bfecc73.webm?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/2f42c3a8df0f9579306f585e4bfecc73.mp4?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploring a Broken World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your route across a semi-randomized world map where each node offers distinct rewards, risks, and opportunities to shape your run. Choose between relic hunts, combat trials, upgrades, or more permanent currency as you push deeper toward the core. Along the way you encounter some of the world\u2019s surviving denizens from whom you can learn more about the world\u2019s state and the forces that shaped it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run helps you grow stronger, more capable and more prepared for the challenges that lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/91740bcd5441fd467610c4b788e61fe4.poster.avif?t=1773908391\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/91740bcd5441fd467610c4b788e61fe4.webm?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/91740bcd5441fd467610c4b788e61fe4.mp4?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 handcrafted biomes with varied enemy families</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 mechanically distinct major bosses and 10 miniboss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-randomized world map with meaningful path choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45\u201360 minute full runs once mastered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endgame Realm Distortions challenge system</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Crossing Realms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383100/9b5730707609d0d9a24b770388a57a562a1ad134.jpg"},{"name":"Point of No Return","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383100/ea78b92ba21450c51f6bb39c74969d64c433f1f7.jpg"},{"name":"Mortal Reminder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383100/56456a2ae9e5ab5adf065dda20c3054f8dcb5abc.jpg"},{"name":"Swift as a Saga","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383100/f00c3e545490e706453800e3d65619039b9e7bc8.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Resonance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383100/1adcba1621fc2f4c936698842a81a17663d9d138.jpg"},{"name":"Forged in Myth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383100/7fae1af1a2532c723b21725e41cac448839d2f5a.jpg"},{"name":"Arcane Apex","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383100/11dac0d1b0010ce9442a036af8fa3613595b9053.jpg"},{"name":"Pomppomp Express","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383100/f61a85d7dce958dbbd7e5bd102f0b18b761d8197.jpg"},{"name":"Trial and Terror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383100/aa3030e65895c58757c597d6f723d11aae38898c.jpg"},{"name":"Clean Sweep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383100/c5a8732d451984d64f0387480423ddb511408c90.jpg"}],"total":37},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3383100?t=1773908391","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/6f9