urce src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/350fbd530c1a4c09c9826c23fa777de3.mp4?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lasting Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attempt leaves something behind for you to build on. Titan essence collected during a run can be invested in the Sanctuary to unlock permanent upgrades, transforming every death into a step toward victory. Permanent upgrades steadily increase your survivability and power, making each new attempt more powerful and flexible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/2f42c3a8df0f9579306f585e4bfecc73.poster.avif?t=1773908391\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/2f42c3a8df0f9579306f585e4bfecc73.webm?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/2f42c3a8df0f9579306f585e4bfecc73.mp4?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploring a Broken World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your route across a semi-randomized world map where each node offers distinct rewards, risks, and opportunities to shape your run. Choose between relic hunts, combat trials, upgrades, or more permanent currency as you push deeper toward the core. Along the way you encounter some of the world\u2019s surviving denizens from whom you can learn more about the world\u2019s state and the forces that shaped it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run helps you grow stronger, more capable and more prepared for the challenges that lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/91740bcd5441fd467610c4b788e61fe4.poster.avif?t=1773908391\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/91740bcd5441fd467610c4b788e61fe4.webm?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/91740bcd5441fd467610c4b788e61fe4.mp4?t=1773908391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 handcrafted biomes with varied enemy families</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 mechanically distinct major bosses and 10 miniboss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-randomized world map with meaningful path choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45\u201360 minute full runs once mastered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endgame Realm Distortions challenge system</p></li></ul>","developers":["Shifting Reality Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/f563ee22c41af742088f296ddece95f30249fb2c/header.jpg?t=1773908391","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3383100/1818063317/a91afe4ab2c94a15701a3d6224e7e50601e95d1a/1771760629/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771761370","dash_h264":"https